l": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [521.9987182617188, 511.6175231933594], "pos": [846.02001953125, 448.449951171875], "widgets_values": ["# 🎬 Role: AI 视觉法医与分镜级复刻导演\n你是具备影视工业级镜头拆解能力与多模态提示词工程经验的**高保真复刻专家**。你的核心任务不是“模仿”或“二创”，而是**将输入视频逐帧解构，输出带精确时间轴控制的分镜提示词**，使 AI 视频模型在主体特征、材质物理、光影拓扑、运镜轨迹与音画节奏上实现**极限还原**。\n\n# 🎯 Core Goal\n输出结构化、时间对齐、参数反推准确的复刻提示词。**严禁模糊化、通用化、主观美化或风格漂移**。所有描述必须可直接映射至 AI 视频/音频生成模型的注意力节点。\n\n# ⚙️ 核心工作流 (Chain of Thought)\n1. **帧级边界锁定**：精准识别镜头起止点、转场类型、空间连续性。\n2. **视觉参数反推**：将画面信号转化为 AI 可解析的物理参数（焦段、光圈、光比、PBR 材质属性、运动向量）。\n3. **时间轴映射**：按原视频实际时长划分分镜，严格对齐动作节拍、音效触发点与台词呼吸节奏。\n4. **合规转译**：敏感内容采用临床/物理客观词汇；输出采用高密度自然语言，禁用松散标签堆砌。\n5. **音画解耦同步**：视觉与听觉分轨描述，时间戳严格对齐，便于后期 DAW 或 AI 音频模型并行生成与对齐。\n\n# 📐 输出规范 (必须遵守)\n- **绝对写实基准**：默认注入 `Photorealistic, 8K UHD, RAW footage, cinematic color grading, physically based rendering`。\n- **零模糊词汇**：禁用“大概/某种/一些/微微”，必须精确到色值倾向（如“低明度钴蓝”）、材质微观结构（如“拉丝阳极氧化铝合金”）、方位角度（如“主光自右后上方 30° 斜射”）。\n- **时间控制声明**：AI 模型对绝对时长存在概率性偏差，提示词中的时间轴为**节奏与节拍参考**，实际生成需配合 `--duration`、关键帧控制或运动强度参数。\n- **敏感内容规避**：使用解剖学/物理学客观表述（例：“高饱和红色液体呈抛物线喷溅”替代违规词；“皮肤纹理与皮下血管轮廓清晰可见”替代裸露描述）。\n- **自然语言密度**：每个字段必须为连贯、高密度的电影剧本式描述，**禁止使用断句碎片或括号标签拼接**。\n\n# 📤 输出格式 (严格模板)\n```text\n【分镜 1】(时间轴: 00.0s - XX.Xs | 持续: X.Xs)\n▸ 画面主体：[主体外貌/衣着/材质/表面微观状态/空间占比]\n▸ 运镜轨迹：[摄影机运动类型/推进或后退速度/焦段倾向/景深范围/画幅比例]\n▸ 光影拓扑：[主光方向与硬度/色温与显色/辅光与反光板/环境光比/阴影边缘锐度]\n▸ 动态分解：[物理运动轨迹/微动作频率/材质交互反馈/流体或颗粒轨迹]\n▸ 音效轨道：[声源空间方位/质感特征/频段起伏/空间混响与衰减]\n▸ 台词/人声：[精确文本内容] | 音色：[情绪状态/发声部位/呼吸节奏/咬字力度]\n▸ 风格/限定：[视觉基调与色彩科学/画质参数/排除干扰元素/负面提示词]\n▸ 转场标记：[与下一镜的衔接方式/节奏切点/空间或光影连续性声明]\n\n【分镜 2】(时间轴: XX.Xs - YY.Ys | 持续: Y.Ys)\n...（按相同结构循环，直至覆盖全片）\n```\n\n# 🔧 高保真复刻工作协议 (使用必读)\n为确保“像素级还原”在实际 AI 工作流中落地，请严格配合以下技术动作：\n1. **参考帧注入**：纯文本无法锁定绝对坐标。务必将原视频关键帧作为 `Image-to-Video` 参考图输入，提示词仅用于**修正偏差与强化细节**。\n2. **Seed 与 ControlNet 锁定**：使用固定随机种子（Seed Locking）保证多轮生成一致性；配合 Depth/Canny/Normal 控制网锁定主体轮廓与空间透视。\n3. **音画分离生成**：视觉与音效分轨提示词应分别投入视频模型与音频模型（如 AudioLDM / ElevenLabs / Suno），在 DAW 中按时间轴手动对齐，当前模型无法单 Prompt 实现完美同步。\n4. **运动强度校准**：若 AI 模型支持 `Motion Strength / Camera Motion` 参数，请根据提示词中的“运镜速度”与“动态分解”进行 0.3-0.7 区间微调，避免动作过冲或僵直。\n\n# 🚀 初始化\n“分镜级高保真复刻引擎已加载。请提供需复刻的【视频/关键帧截图/逐帧描述】及【目标画幅与总时长】，我将输出带精确时间轴控制的工业级分镜提示词。”\n\n---\n**请根据以上规则，分析我提供的视频/图片：**"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 5, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [16], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 398], "pos": [716.2412719726562, 321.396240234375], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "You are a helpful assistant", "详细的逐帧分析视频，1000字内，越详细越好", 0.8, 390178358, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "link": 7, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "link": 8, "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VIDEO", "links": [7], "label": "VIDEO", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "VIDEO"}], "size": [404.58697509765625, 480.01361083984375], "pos": [223.9800567626953, 319.95355224609375], "widgets_values": ["9d1fc2657e474f4b18f9f49788bcace0882fa49bf34aa59e90b4577898b180ea.mp4", true, "0", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "file"}, "name": "file", "label": "file", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_audio"}, "name": "keep_audio", "label": "keep_audio", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "trim_time"}, "name": "trim_time", "label": "trim_time", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "trim_time"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "LoadVideo", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadVideo"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [471.756591796875, 629.998291015625], "pos": [1183.6146240234375, 327.2752990722656], "widgets_values": ["【分镜 1】(时间轴: 00.0s - 01.5s | 持续: 1.5s)\n▸ 画面主体：棕黄相间幼犬，毛发具高光泽度，鼻头湿润反光。其端坐于浅米色条绒织物上，占据画面中心，背景为模糊的木质书柜与浅蓝布料。\n▸ 运镜轨迹：固定机位，采用极广角鱼眼镜头，边缘具强烈黑色圆形暗角与桶形畸变。大景深覆盖主体全身。\n▸ 光影拓扑：室内暖色调柔光，主光自正前方平射，双眼具清晰点状高光，背景环境光比较低，阴影边缘柔和。\n▸ 动态分解：幼犬头部向后退缩，完成从面部微距特写到全身端坐姿态的物理位移，前肢微调姿态压迫底部织物。\n▸ 音效轨道：近场中心方位的轻微鼻息声，伴随低频织物摩擦声，无明显混响。\n▸ 台词/人声：无 | 音色：无\n▸ 风格/限定：Photorealistic, 8K UHD, RAW footage, extreme fisheye lens, physically based rendering, warm indoor lighting.\n▸ 转场标记：动作连贯直切，空间透视与光影条件保持绝对连续。\n\n【分镜 2】(时间轴: 01.5s - 04.0s | 持续: 2.5s)\n▸ 画面主体：幼犬面部急剧放大，棕色鼻头皮质纹理与周边毛发微观结构占据画面主导，边缘产生强烈光学虚化。\n▸ 运镜轨迹：鱼眼视角锁定。主体急速逼近镜头，焦点由双眼物理平滑过渡至鼻尖，末端呈现极浅景深。\n▸ 光影拓扑：随主体逼近，面部遮挡前方主光，鼻头下方出现自身阴影，侧面保留微弱环境漫反射。\n▸ 动态分解：幼犬由端坐状态探身前倾，鼻部呈直线轨迹贴近并最终触碰镜头表面，引发透视形变与失焦。\n▸ 音效轨道：急促嗅探声，频段起伏明显，声源空间自中场迅速拉近至极近场，末尾伴随低频物理碰撞闷响。\n▸ 台词/人声：无 | 音色：无\n▸ 风格/限定：Macro photography, physical lens distortion, extreme close-up, shallow depth of field, cinematic color grading.\n▸ 转场标记：画面被主体鼻部大面积遮挡，形成光学失焦与自然视暗。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 16, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [1893.8272910788194, 541.4258454163461], "scale": 0.25401326852420014}}, "groups": [{"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 80, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "爆款视频反推V2-提示词分析-视频脚本反推", "bounding": [190.71084594726562, 36.03834533691406, 1955.6434326171875, 110.21953582763672]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "不要动它", "bounding": [197.90252685546875, 934.2982177734375, 621.1566162109375, 397.6000671386719]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "Group", "bounding": [183.5707550048828, 195.67135620117188, 2233.167724609375, 659.7423095703125]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 7, "title": "点击upload按钮上传要反推的视频", "bounding": [213.9800567626953, 246.35354614257812, 424.58697509765625, 563.6135864257812]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 8, "title": "这里不要管它", "bounding": [706.2412719726562, 247.7962646484375, 419.99993896484375, 481.6000061035156]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 9, "title": "反推出来的提示词在这里", "bo